  "description": "MIHJEV crystallizes in the tetragonal crystal system with space group I 41/a. Reported CIF formula moiety: C76 H40 F36 N8 O20 Sm4,2(C3 H6 O1). From the CIF bond table, Sm1 (Sm) has 7 O neighbors; Sm2 (Sm) has 7 O neighbors; Sm3 (Sm) has 7 O neighbors; Sm4 (Sm) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 6 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.915-4.004 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 105.78-111.34°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C76H40N8O20F36Sm4.",
